# Device Receipts receipt: turnstone reads its own resident host through the
# first-party door and shows the cards. Requires the resident device host
# (graphshell-device-host) to be running with the app endpoint served; the
# service connects at startup and again on Refresh.
settle 30
key escape

# Summon the pane. The service already read once at shell start; the first
# capture may still show the connecting status, so settle generously and
# capture twice.
act Open Device Receipts pane
settle 60
capture 01_device_receipts_opened

# One explicit refresh through the pane's own button path is exercised by
# clicking the Refresh row; the service opens a fresh session, which is also
# how new receipts become visible.
settle 120
capture 02_device_receipts_settled
